libc++ (LLVM 18) std::__bind_back (the core of std::views::take): the calls
compute the right values, but two __tuple_impl(_Tuple &&) bodies
(tuple:488) are dropped.  Not reduced yet.  clang++ 18 -stdlib=libc++
accepts this program, and it fails only its WRONG assertion.
